# Clause 9: Performance Evaluation

## Overview
Clause 9 addresses how organisations evaluate ISMS performance through monitoring, auditing, and management review.

## Gaps in this Clause

| Gap | Title | Risk | Status |
|-----|-------|------|--------|
| GAP-014 | Monitoring and Measurement | MEDIUM | Not Implemented |
| GAP-015 | Internal Audit | HIGH | Not Implemented |
| GAP-016 | Management Review | HIGH | Not Implemented |

## Key Requirements

- Monitor and measure ISMS performance
- Conduct regular internal audits
- Hold periodic management reviews
- Analyze effectiveness
- Identify improvement opportunities

## Remediation Priority

**HIGH** — Without monitoring, auditing, and review, there is no visibility into ISMS effectiveness or compliance.
